{"id": "e198996e-90e3-450d-b51e-ea4ff413766d", "revision": 0, "last_node_id": 11, "last_link_id": 13, "nodes": [{"id": 1, "type": "MarkdownNote", "pos": [20, 40], "size": [380, 560], "flags": {}, "order": 0, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [], "title": "Como usar", "properties": {}, "widgets_values": ["# Fibo 2.0 Camera Angles\n\n1. Carregue a foto em **Load Image**. Ela aparece no cartão do meio da visão 3D.\n2. No **Fibo Camera Angles**, arraste as bolinhas:\n   - **rosa** (no círculo): gira a câmera em volta da pessoa\n   - **verde** (no arco): sobe ou desce a câmera\n   - **amarela** (na reta): aproxima ou afasta\n   A rodinha do mouse também aproxima/afasta. Embaixo há menus com ângulos prontos e o ↺ volta para a frente.\n3. Em **subject**, diga quem é: *the man*, *the woman*, *the car*...\n4. Clique em **Run**.\n\n### Dicas\n- O Fibo obedece bem a **giro** (perfil, costas, ¾) e **enquadramento** (corpo inteiro, cintura, rosto). Altura funciona melhor em valores fortes.\n- Se ficar igual à foto, aumente o ângulo ou troque a **seed**.\n- Ângulos são relativos à câmera original: 0 = frente, +90 = câmera vai para a direita, 180 = costas.\n- Desligue **subject_is_person** para objetos e carros.\n- O texto que vai para o Fibo aparece em **Texto enviado ao Fibo**.\n\nModelo: Fibo 2.0 edit turbo (4 steps, CFG 1). Licença CC BY-NC 4.0."], "color": "#432", "bgcolor": "#653"}, {"id": 2, "type": "LoadImage", "pos": [420, 40], "size": [340, 460], "flags": {}, "order": 1, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "links": [1, 2]}, {"name": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "links": null}], "title": "Load Image - Sua foto", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "widgets_values": ["fibo2_test_source.png", "image"]}, {"id": 3, "type": "FiboCameraAngles", "pos": [790, 40], "size": [460, 820], "flags": {}, "order": 5, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"name": "image", "shape": 7, "type": "IMAGE", "link": 1}, {"name": "extra", "shape": 7, "type": "STRING", "link": null}], "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "links": [5, 6]}, {"name": "camera_info", "type": "STRING", "links": null}], "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "FiboCameraAngles"}, "widgets_values": [0, 0, 5, "the man", true, "Keep the same person, face, hair, clothing, lighting and environment; only the camera viewpoint changes.", ""]}, {"id": 4, "type": "UNETLoader", "pos": [420, 540], "size": [340, 82], "flags": {}, "order": 2, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "links": [7]}], "title": "Diffusion model - Fibo 2.0 edit turbo", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "UNETLoader"}, "widgets_values": ["fibo\\fibo2_edit_turbo_int8_convrot.safetensors", "default"]}, {"id": 5, "type": "CLIPLoader", "pos": [420, 650], "size": [340, 106], "flags": {}, "order": 3, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [{"name": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "links": [3]}], "title": "Text encoder - Qwen3-VL 4B", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "CLIPLoader"}, "widgets_values": ["qwen3vl_4b_int8_convrot.safetensors", "fibo2", "default"]}, {"id": 6, "type": "VAELoader", "pos": [420, 780], "size": [340, 58], "flags": {}, "order": 4, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [{"name": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "links": [4, 12]}], "title": "VAE", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "VAELoader"}, "widgets_values": ["flux2-vae.safetensors"]}, {"id": 7, "type": "TextEncodeFibo2", "pos": [1280, 40], "size": [360, 314], "flags": {}, "order": 6, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "link": 3}, {"name": "images.image_1", "shape": 7, "type": "IMAGE", "link": 2}, {"name": "images.image_2", "shape": 7, "type": "IMAGE", "link": null}, {"name": "images.image_3", "shape": 7, "type": "IMAGE", "link": null}, {"name": "images.image_4", "shape": 7, "type": "IMAGE", "link": null}, {"name": "vae", "shape": 7, "type": "VAE", "link": 4}, {"name": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "link": 5}], "outputs": [{"name": "positive", "type": "C